  designNotes: 'The user, 2026-10-16: frontier AI labs lobbying the government for
    rules strict enough that no newcomer can compete, while they burn through cash
    and play the victim. Regulatory capture: every enemy creature still deploying
    waits 1 more Day; the lobbying isn''t free, you take 2 damage.'
  artDescription: Two tech executives in hoodies at a congressional hearing table,
    one tearfully holding up a sign reading REGULATE US (ONLY), the other quietly
    sliding a rulebook titled BARRIERS TO ENTRY across to a smiling senator, a burning
    pile of cash under the table.
